  "title": "Lentil Salad with Chimichurri Sauce",
  "description": "Steamed lentils and feta cheese are tossed in a homemade chimichurri sauce made with fresh herbs creating an easy lentil salad.",
  "authors": [
    "Kim luvscooking"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-06-08T10:07:31-04:00",
